# 规则概述
在C#属性定义中，建议在每个访问器之间添加一个空行，以提高代码的可读性和一致性。

## 规则意义
在访问器之间添加空行可以使代码结构更加清晰，提升代码可读性。特别是当访问器包含多行代码时，空行将帮助开发者更容易区分不同的访问器部分。

## 错误示例
'''csharp
string P
{
    get
    {
        return _p;
    }
    set
    {
        _p = value;
    }
}
'''

## 正确示例
'''csharp
string P
{
    get
    {
        return _p;
    }

    set
    {
        _p = value;
    }
}
'''

rules.content_en:
# Rule Overview
In C# property definitions, it is recommended to add a blank line between each accessor to enhance the readability and consistency of the code.

## Rule Meaning
Adding a blank line between accessors can make the code structure clearer and improve code readability. It is especially helpful when accessors contain multiple lines of code, as it makes it easier for developers to distinguish between different parts of the accessors.

## Error Example
'''csharp
string P
{
    get
    {
        return _p;
    }
    set
    {
        _p = value;
    }
}
'''

## Correct Example
'''csharp
string P
{
    get
    {
        return _p;
    }

    set
    {
        _p = value;
    }
}
'''

