# 规则概述
在处理参数或成员名称时，应使用`nameof`运算符以提高代码的可维护性和安全性。

## 规则意义
使用`nameof`运算符可以减少因重构或代码修改导致的错误。它能确保当参数或变量名称改变时，相应的字符串引用无需手动更新，从而减少潜在错误。

## 错误示例
'''csharp
public void Foo(object parameter)
{
    if (parameter == null)
    {
        throw new ArgumentNullException("parameter", "message");
    }
}
'''

## 正确示例
'''csharp
public void Foo(object parameter)
{
    if (parameter == null)
    {
        throw new ArgumentNullException(nameof(parameter), "message");
    }
}
'''

rules.content_en:
# Rule Overview
The `nameof` operator should be used when dealing with parameter or member names for better code maintainability and security.

## Rule Meaning
Using the `nameof` operator reduces the risk of errors introduced by refactoring or code changes. It ensures that when a parameter or variable name changes, the corresponding string reference is automatically updated, minimizing potential errors.

## Error Example
'''csharp
public void Foo(object parameter)
{
    if (parameter == null)
    {
        throw new ArgumentNullException("parameter", "message");
    }
}
'''

## Correct Example
'''csharp
public void Foo(object parameter)
{
    if (parameter == null)
    {
        throw new ArgumentNullException(nameof(parameter), "message");
    }
}
'''

