# 规则概述
在多线程环境中使用锁机制时，锁定对象应该是私有的，以防止外部对象对其进行访问和控制。

## 规则意义
在公开可访问的实例上加锁可能导致死锁或其他不稳定的线程行为。通过确保加锁对象是私有的，可以提高代码的安全性和稳定性，防止外部代码意外地干扰应用的线程同步。

## 错误示例
```csharp
public void Foo()
{
    lock (this)
    {
    }
}
```

## 正确示例
```csharp
private readonly object _lockObject = new object();

public void Foo()
{
    lock (_lockObject)
    {
    }
}
```

rules.content_en:
# Rule Overview
When using locking mechanisms in a multithreaded environment, the locked object should be private to prevent access and manipulation from outside.

## Rule Meaning
Locking on a publicly accessible instance may lead to deadlocks or other unstable threading behavior. By ensuring that the locked object is private, code security and stability are improved, preventing external code from inadvertently interfering with application thread synchronization.

## Error Example
```csharp
public void Foo()
{
    lock (this)
    {
    }
}
```

## Correct Example
```csharp
private readonly object _lockObject = new object();

public void Foo()
{
    lock (_lockObject)
    {
    }
}
```

