# 规则概述
避免在捕获 `System.Exception` 时使用空捕获子句。空捕获子句会隐藏异常，可能导致程序问题而难以排查。

## 规则意义
在捕获 `System.Exception` 时空捕获子句没有任何处理逻辑，这会掩盖潜在的应用程序错误，导致错误信息丢失，提高了调试和维护的难度。

## 错误示例
'''csharp
try
{
    Foo();
}
catch (Exception ex)
{
    // 空捕获，没有处理异常
}
'''

## 正确示例
'''csharp
try
{
    Foo();
}
catch (Exception ex)
{
    Console.WriteLine(ex.Message); // 记录异常信息
    throw; // 重新抛出异常以便上层处理
}
'''

rules.content_en:
# Rule Overview
Avoid using empty catch clauses when catching `System.Exception`. Empty catch clauses can hide exceptions, leading to potential debugging difficulties.

## Rule Meaning
An empty catch clause that catches `System.Exception` does not handle any exception, which can lead to loss of error information and increase the difficulty in debugging and maintaining the application.

## Error Example
'''csharp
try
{
    Foo();
}
catch (Exception ex)
{
    // Empty catch block, no exception handling
}
'''

## Correct Example
'''csharp
try
{
    Foo();
}
catch (Exception ex)
{
    Console.WriteLine(ex.Message); // Log the exception message
    throw; // Re-throw the exception to be handled further up
}
'''

