# 规则概述
此规则通过将简单的`if-else`结构转换为赋值操作以简化代码。

## 规则意义
通过减少代码的复杂度和改进可读性，提升代码质量。简单的`if-else`在满足条件时可以直接转换成赋值操作，使代码更加清晰。

## 错误示例
```csharp
if (condition)
{
    f = true;
}
else
{
    f = false;
}
```

## 正确示例
```csharp
f = condition;
```

rules.content_en:
# Rule Overview
This rule simplifies code by converting simple `if-else` structures to assignment operations.

## Rule Meaning
By reducing code complexity and improving readability, enhance the quality of the code. Simple `if-else` statements can be converted directly to assignment operations when conditions are met, making the code clearer.

## Error Example
```csharp
if (condition)
{
    f = true;
}
else
{
    f = false;
}
```

## Correct Example
```csharp
f = condition;
```

