# 规则概述
此规则用于检测并移除不必要的`ToCharArray`调用，因为在许多情况下，可以直接迭代字符串字符而无需先转换为字符数组。

## 规则意义
去除冗余的`ToCharArray`调用可以提高代码性能并优化资源使用，对于字符串迭代特别有意义，特别是在不需要数组特性的情况下。

## 错误示例
```csharp
foreach (char ch in s.ToCharArray())
{
    // 执行一些操作
}
```

## 正确示例
```csharp
foreach (char ch in s)
{
    // 执行一些操作
}
```

rules.content_en:
# Rule Overview
This rule detects and removes unnecessary `ToCharArray` method calls since it's often possible to iterate directly over string characters without converting them to a character array first.

## Rule Meaning
Removing redundant `ToCharArray` calls can improve code performance and optimize resource use, especially for string iteration when array features are not required.

## Error Example
```csharp
foreach (char ch in s.ToCharArray())
{
    // Perform some operations
}
```

## Correct Example
```csharp
foreach (char ch in s)
{
    // Perform some operations
}
```

