# 规则概述
在含有多个部分声明的类中，应确保所有声明都具有相同的修饰符，以保持代码的一致性和可读性。此规则建议为所有部分类声明添加'static'修饰符，以避免潜在的类行为不一致。

## 规则意义
确保类的所有部分声明具有一致的修饰符能够提高代码可读性，减少潜在错误，并使设计意图清晰明了。

## 错误示例
```csharp
public static partial class Foo
{
}

public partial class Foo
{
}
```

## 正确示例
```csharp
public static partial class Foo
{
}

public static partial class Foo
{
}
```

rules.content_en:
# Rule Overview
In a class with multiple partial declarations, all declarations should have the same modifier to maintain code consistency and readability. This rule suggests adding the 'static' modifier to all partial class declarations to prevent potential inconsistent class behavior.

## Rule Meaning
Ensuring that all partial class declarations have consistent modifiers can improve code readability, reduce potential errors, and clarify design intent.

## Error Example
```csharp
public static partial class Foo
{
}

public partial class Foo
{
}
```

## Correct Example
```csharp
public static partial class Foo
{
}

public static partial class Foo
{
}
```

