# 规则概述
为包含多条语句的switch分支添加大括号，以提高代码的可读性和可维护性。

## 规则意义
在多个语句的情况下使用大括号可以有效避免逻辑错误，并提高代码的清晰度和一致性。

## 错误示例
```csharp
switch (s)
{
    case "a":
        Foo();
        break;
}
```

## 正确示例
```csharp
switch (s)
{
    case "a":
        {
            Foo();
            break;
        }
}
```

rules.content_en:
# Rule Overview
Add braces to switch sections containing multiple statements to improve code readability and maintainability.

## Rule Meaning
Using braces for multiple statements helps prevent logic errors and increases code clarity and consistency.

## Error Example
```csharp
switch (s)
{
    case "a":
        Foo();
        break;
}
```

## Correct Example
```csharp
switch (s)
{
    case "a":
        {
            Foo();
            break;
        }
}
```

