# 规则概述
该规则建议为`if-else`语句添加大括号，即使在单个语句的情况下，这有助于提高代码的可读性和维护性。

## 规则意义
为`if-else`语句添加大括号可以防止因后期维护新增语句时遗漏大括号导致语义错误，并提升代码的一致性和可读性。

## 错误示例
```csharp
if (condition)
    Foo();
else
    Bar();
```

## 正确示例
```csharp
if (condition)
{
    Foo();
}
else
{
    Bar();
}
```

rules.content_en:
# Rule Overview
This rule suggests adding braces to `if-else` statements, even when they contain a single statement, to improve code readability and maintainability.

## Rule Meaning
Adding braces to `if-else` statements prevents semantic errors that may occur if braces are omitted when adding new statements later, and enhances code consistency and readability.

## Error Example
```csharp
if (condition)
    Foo();
else
    Bar();
```

## Correct Example
```csharp
if (condition)
{
    Foo();
}
else
{
    Bar();
}
```

