# 规则概述
此规则建议在代码中使用合并表达式（??）来简化对空值的判断和赋值。

## 规则意义
合并表达式可以使代码更简洁、易读并减少重复代码，从而提高代码的维护性。

## 错误示例
'''csharp
string s = GetValue();

if (s == null)
{
    s = "";
}
'''

## 正确示例
'''csharp
string s = GetValue() ?? "";
'''

rules.content_en:
# Rule Overview
This rule suggests using the coalesce expression (??) in the code to simplify null checks and assignments.

## Rule Meaning
The coalesce expression can make the code more concise, readable, and reduce duplicate code, thus improving code maintainability.

## Error Example
'''csharp
string s = GetValue();

if (s == null)
{
    s = "";
}
'''

## Correct Example
'''csharp
string s = GetValue() ?? "";
'''

