# 规则概述
此规则用于检测并移除代码中不必要的重写成员。这些重写成员没有增加任何新功能，仅仅是调用了基类的实现。

## 规则意义
去除冗余的重写成员可以使代码更加简洁，提高代码的可读性，并减少维护成本。

## 错误示例
```csharp
public class Foo
{
    public override string ToString()
    {
        return base.ToString();
    }
}
```

## 正确示例
```csharp
public class Foo
{
}
```

rules.content_en:
# Rule Overview
This rule detects and removes unnecessary overriding members in the code. These overriding members do not add any new functionality and merely call the base class implementation.

## Rule Meaning
Removing redundant overriding members makes code more concise, improves readability, and reduces maintenance overhead.

## Error Example
```csharp
public class Foo
{
    public override string ToString()
    {
        return base.ToString();
    }
}
```

## Correct Example
```csharp
public class Foo
{
}
```

