# 规则概述
该规则旨在确保迭代器方法（包含 `yield` 的方法）在被调用时立即验证其参数，而不是在调用者开始枚举结果项时才验证。

## 规则意义
在迭代器方法中，由于延迟执行的特性，参数验证可能被推迟到方法调用后的一段时间才进行，这可能导致延迟的异常抛出和运行时错误。遵循此规则有助于提前捕获错误，提高代码的可靠性和健壮性。

## 错误示例
```csharp
IEnumerable<object> Foo(IEnumerable<object> items)
{
    if (items == null)
        throw new ArgumentNullException(nameof(items));

    foreach (object item in items)
        yield return item;
}
```

## 正确示例
```csharp
IEnumerable<object> Foo(IEnumerable<object> items)
{
    if (items == null)
        throw new ArgumentNullException(nameof(items));

    return FooIterator();

    IEnumerable<object> FooIterator()
    {
        foreach (object item in items)
            yield return item;    
    }
}
```

rules.content_en:
# Rule Overview
This rule ensures that iterator methods (methods containing `yield`) validate their arguments immediately when the method is called, rather than when the caller begins to enumerate the result items.

## Rule Meaning
Due to the deferred execution nature of iterator methods, argument validation may be delayed until some time after the method is invoked, potentially causing delayed exception throwing and runtime errors. This rule helps to catch errors early, enhancing code reliability and robustness.

## Error Example
```csharp
IEnumerable<object> Foo(IEnumerable<object> items)
{
    if (items == null)
        throw new ArgumentNullException(nameof(items));

    foreach (object item in items)
        yield return item;
}
```

## Correct Example
```csharp
IEnumerable<object> Foo(IEnumerable<object> items)
{
    if (items == null)
        throw new ArgumentNullException(nameof(items));

    return FooIterator();

    IEnumerable<object> FooIterator()
    {
        foreach (object item in items)
            yield return item;    
    }
}
```

