# 规则概述
此规则用于检测并简化不必要的数学运算形式的数字比较表达式。通过移除不必要的运算，代码可读性和性能可能会有所提升。

## 规则意义
在代码中对两个数字进行比较时，常常会见到形式如 `(a - b) == 0` 这样的表达式。这种表达式可以被简化为 `a == b`，使代码更简洁易懂，维护和性能优化的工作都会变得更加简单。

## 错误示例
'''csharp
// 不必要的数学运算
if ((a - b) == 0) { /* ... */ }
if ((a - b) > 0) { /* ... */ }
if ((a - b) >= 0) { /* ... */ }
if ((a - b) < 0) { /* ... */ }
if ((a - b) <= 0) { /* ... */ }
'''

## 正确示例
'''csharp
// 简化后的比较
if (a == b) { /* ... */ }
if (a > b) { /* ... */ }
if (a >= b) { /* ... */ }
if (a < b) { /* ... */ }
if (a <= b) { /* ... */ }
'''

rules.content_en:
# Rule Overview
This rule identifies and simplifies unnecessary arithmetic forms of numeric comparison expressions. By eliminating unnecessary operations, code readability and performance may be improved.

## Rule Meaning
When comparing two numbers in code, expressions like `(a - b) == 0` are often found. These expressions can be simplified to `a == b`, making the code cleaner and easier to understand, and simplifying maintenance and performance optimization tasks.

## Error Example
'''csharp
// Unnecessary arithmetic operations
if ((a - b) == 0) { /* ... */ }
if ((a - b) > 0) { /* ... */ }
if ((a - b) >= 0) { /* ... */ }
if ((a - b) < 0) { /* ... */ }
if ((a - b) <= 0) { /* ... */ }
'''

## Correct Example
'''csharp
// Simplified comparisons
if (a == b) { /* ... */ }
if (a > b) { /* ... */ }
if (a >= b) { /* ... */ }
if (a < b) { /* ... */ }
if (a <= b) { /* ... */ }
'''

