# 规则概述
使用模式匹配可以提高C#代码的可读性和简洁性，减少类型转换和条件语句的冗余。

## 规则意义
通过使用模式匹配，开发人员可以避免传统的类型检查和转换方式，直接在条件语句中进行类型转换和变量赋值，使代码更加直观和简洁。此外，模式匹配还可以优化性能，减少不必要的类型转换操作。

## 错误示例
'''csharp
if (syntaxNode.IsKind(SyntaxKind.IdentifierName))
{
    var identifierName = (IdentifierNameSyntax)syntaxNode;
}

if (!syntaxNode.IsKind(SyntaxKind.IdentifierName))
{
    return;
}

var identifierName = (IdentifierNameSyntax)syntaxNode;
'''

## 正确示例
'''csharp
if (syntaxNode is IdentifierNameSyntax identifierName)
{
}

if (!(syntaxNode is IdentifierNameSyntax identifierName))
{
  return;
}
'''

rules.content_en:
# Rule Overview
Pattern matching can improve the readability and conciseness of C# code by reducing redundant type casting and conditional statements.

## Rule Meaning
By utilizing pattern matching, developers avoid traditional type checks and casts by directly performing both type check and assignment within the conditional statement, making the code more intuitive and concise. Additionally, pattern matching can improve performance by reducing unnecessary type casts.

## Error Example
'''csharp
if (syntaxNode.IsKind(SyntaxKind.IdentifierName))
{
    var identifierName = (IdentifierNameSyntax)syntaxNode;
}

if (!syntaxNode.IsKind(SyntaxKind.IdentifierName))
{
    return;
}

var identifierName = (IdentifierNameSyntax)syntaxNode;
'''

## Correct Example
'''csharp
if (syntaxNode is IdentifierNameSyntax identifierName)
{
}

if (!(syntaxNode is IdentifierNameSyntax identifierName))
{
  return;
}
'''

